agraph" dir=3D"auto">The user is asking if I can create a template app simi=
lar to ODMobile (OpenDental's mobile application). This is a request to bui=
ld an application or template.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">I=
 need to clarify what I can and cannot do:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div cl=
ass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">I cannot create actual deployable mobile app=
lications (iOS/Android apps) or full backend systems.</div></li><li><div cl=
ass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">I can create interactive HTML widgets, proto=
types, or mockups using the <code data-v-8d822fd1=3D"" data-v-3b9ae98b=3D""=
 class=3D"segment-code-inline">show_widget</code> tool.</div></li><li><div =
class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">I can create data visualizations, charts, =
or simple interactive tools.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D=
"auto">OpenDental is a dental practice management software, and ODMobile is=
 their mobile companion app. It typically includes features like:</div><ul =
start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Appointment schedulin=
g/viewing</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Patient infor=
mation</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Treatment plans<=
/div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Prescriptions</div></li=
><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Billing/insurance info</div></li=
><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Clinical notes</div></li><li><di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Imaging/X-rays</div></li><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Secure messaging</div></li></ul><div class=3D"p=
aragraph" dir=3D"auto">Since the user asked if I "can" create it, I should:=
</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Be honest a=
bout my limitations (I can't build a real deployable app with backend)</div=
></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Offer what I CAN do - creat=
e an interactive prototype/mockup widget that demonstrates the UI/UX of suc=
h an app</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Ask what speci=
fic features they want to focus on</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" =
dir=3D"auto">I should not just say "no" - I should offer a constructive alt=
ernative. Let me offer to create an interactive prototype widget that simul=
ates the ODMobile experience.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></d=
iv></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b=3D"" data-v-d664c8c3=
=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b=3D"" class=3D"markd=
own"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">I can't build a full, deployable=
 mobile app with a backend database=E2=80=94that requires native developmen=
t tools, app store publishing, and server infrastructure. However, <strong>=
I can absolutely create an interactive prototype/mockup</strong> that looks=
 and feels like ODMobile (OpenDental's mobile app) using an interactive wid=
get.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Here's what I can build for=
