need a backend. I should create an interactive widget that simulates a mobi=
le app interface with the key modules of a dental practice management app.<=
/div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Let me first read the widget ski=
ll to understand the available components, then build a comprehensive mobil=
e app prototype.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Key modules for=
 a dental provider/staff app:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragr=
aph" dir=3D"auto">Dashboard/Home - overview, stats, alerts</div></li><li><d=
iv class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Schedule/Calendar - appointments, day v=
iew</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Patients - patient =
list, search, details</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">T=
reatment Plans - procedures, planned work</div></li><li><div class=3D"parag=
raph" dir=3D"auto">Prescriptions/Rx - medication management</div></li><li><=
div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Billing/Insurance - claims, payments</=
div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Messaging/Tasks - intern=
al communication</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Settin=
gs/Profile</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">I'll create=
 a mobile-first design with a bottom navigation bar, realistic demo data, a=
nd smooth transitions between screens.</div></div></div></div></div> <!----=
