/li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Schedule</strong> =E2=
=80=94 Day-view calendar with color-coded appointment statuses (confirmed, =
waiting, scheduled)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><st=
rong>Patients</strong> =E2=80=94 Searchable patient list with filters, tap =
any patient to open their full record</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Patient Detail</strong> =E2=80=94 4 tabs: Demographi=
cs/Contact/Insurance, Treatment Plans with fee breakdown, Clinical Notes &a=
mp; Allergies, Account Balance &amp; Transactions</div></li><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Prescriptions (Rx)</strong> =E2=80=94 P=
ending meds list with approval workflow</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragra=
ph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Billing</strong> =E2=80=94 Claims overview, insura=
nce aging report, collections stats</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" =
dir=3D"auto"><strong>Messages</strong> =E2=80=94 Internal team communicatio=
n</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Interactive =
Features:</strong></div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D=
"auto">Bottom tab navigation</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"=
