aph" dir=3D"auto">Tap appointments or patients to drill into details</div><=
/li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Back navigation from detail s=
creens</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Filter pills on =
Patients and Rx screens</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"=
>Tab switching within patient records</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragrap=
